hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"588","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Main ne Ibrahim, Musa, aur Isa (Alaihimussalam) ko dekha: Isa (Alaihissalam) chaude aur chaude seene wale the, jabke Musa (Alaihissalam) lambe gandumi rang wale the, aur woh Zutt qaum mein se the.' Aap se poocha gaya: Aur Ibrahim (Alaihissalam) ke bare mein? Aap ne farmaya: 'Woh tumhare saathi (Nabi khud Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se mushabeh hain.'"
"589","[AI-translation] Sufyan Sauri ne isi sanad se isi ki manind riwayat ki: aur kaha: Isa (Alaihissalam) surkh rang aur darmiyane qad wale the. Aur kaha: Woh (Ibrahim Alaihissalam) tumhare saathi se mushabeh hain, yani Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)."
"590","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi ki raan dekhi, to us se farmaya: 'Apni raan dhanko, kyunke aadmi ki raan us ke satr mein se hai.'"
